    <string name="fire_safety_tips">- Evacuate immediately and stay low to avoid smoke\n- Do NOT use elevators; use stairs only\n- Close doors behind you to prevent spread\n- Cover nose and mouth with cloth if needed\n- Call emergency services (911)</string>
    <string name="flood_safety_title">Flood Safety</string>
    <string name="flood_safety_tips">- Move to higher ground immediately\n- Avoid walking or driving through floodwater\n- Stay away from electrical hazards\n- Follow evacuation orders\n- Keep emergency supplies ready</string>
    <string name="typhoon_safety_title">Typhoon Safety</string>
    <string name="typhoon_safety_tips">- Stay indoors and secure your home\n- Prepare emergency kit (food, water, flashlight)\n- Avoid coastal and flood-prone areas\n- Monitor weather updates\n- Charge devices and power banks</string>
